UPDATE companies SET description='Format Furniture operates a high-end furnishings showroom in the SOHO neighborhood of Manhattan, New York. The company was established more than two decades ago by Brazilian designer Sany Marques, who carved a niche in the luxury furniture market by curating collections from international brands. Marques remains the owner, and showroom manager Robin Kay oversees daily operations.

The showroom presents a continuous design philosophy centered on muted colors, non-patterned fabrics, and clean lines. A team of designers and sales consultants works with clients to specify furnishings for entire homes or commercial spaces, offering interior design consultation alongside product selection.

The clientele spans elite residential and commercial sectors. Format has furnished star-studded restaurants in New York and Las Vegas, kitchens and bathrooms for exclusive residential apartment buildings, and custom closets for hotels. The firm positions itself as a one-stop resource for complete project outfitting.

The company emphasizes a personalized experience—espresso or wine service, relaxed viewing, and dedicated design specialists—even as it handles large-volume projects. Marques’ predilection for a cohesive aesthetic gives the showroom a unified look that serves as a springboard for client ideas.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Interior design consultation", "Furniture specification and procurement", "Residential project outfitting", "Commercial project outfitting", "Showroom-based product viewing and selection"], "industries": ["Residential interior design", "Commercial interior design", "Hospitality (restaurants, hotels)", "Multi-family residential development"], "materials": ["Precious wood essences", "Ceramics", "Decorated crystals", "Quality metals"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Curated selection of European luxury furniture brands (Cattelan Italia, Arketipo Firenze)", "Unified showroom aesthetic based on muted palette and clean lines", "Full-scope residential and commercial project outfitting", "In-house design consultation with dedicated specialists", "Personalized client experience including hospitality amenities"], "facts_used": ["Location: SOHO, Manhattan, New York -> /about", "Founder: Brazilian designer Sany Marques -> /about", "Established more than 20 years ago -> /about", "Owner: Sany Marques -> /about", "Showroom manager: Robin Kay -> /about", "Business type: high-end furnishings boutique/showroom -> /about", "Brands carried: Cattelan Italia, Arketipo Firenze -> /, /about", "Design philosophy: muted colors, non-patterned fabrics, clean lines -> /about", "Services: interior design consultation, full home/business outfitting -> /about", "Clientele: elite residential and commercial -> /about", "Projects: restaurants in NY and Las Vegas, residential apartment buildings, hotel custom closets -> /about", "Team: designers and salespeople -> /about", "Materials from brands: precious wood essences, ceramics, decorated crystals, quality metals -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "showroom spotlights impeccably designed inspirations from all over the world featuring some of the world''s most coveted furniture lines", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='format-furniture-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Four-In-One Inc. operates from its headquarters in Chelmsford, Massachusetts, with a second manufacturing facility in San Jose, California. The company, which does business as FOURINONE Inc/LLC, has built a reputation as a manufacturer of single-serving food products for the wholesale market.

Its product line includes homemade sauces, salad dressings, ketchup, jams, jellies, and condiments, all packaged in convenient single-serving sizes. Production takes place across two plants where quality assurance is integrated into manufacturing and packaging processes, supported by state-of-the-art production and packaging machinery and ongoing personnel training.

Four-In-One serves only the wholesale industry, working through a network of institutional food brokers and a distribution system the company describes as among the most efficient in the industry. It does not sell to private consumers, focusing instead on pallet and truckload shipments to wholesale customers.

The company emphasizes its reliable sales and distribution network, efficient delivery system that contributes to competitive pricing, and a commitment to using the finest ingredients. These factors, combined with continuous staff training and modern equipment, are presented as the foundation of its product quality and on-time delivery record.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Food manufacturing", "Sauce and condiment production", "Single-serving packaging", "Quality assurance", "Wholesale distribution", "Institutional food broker partnerships"], "industries": ["Wholesale food industry", "Institutional food service"], "materials": ["Food ingredients"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Reliable sales and distribution network with institutional food brokers", "Efficient delivery system enabling competitive pricing", "Quality assurance integrated into manufacturing and packaging", "State-of-the-art production and packaging machinery", "Ongoing personnel training"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Chelmsford, MA -> db", "Second facility in San Jose, CA -> /", "Manufacturer of fine food products -> /", "Products: homemade sauces, salad dressings, ketchup, jams, jellies, condiments, single-serving sizes -> /", "Processes: manufacturing and packaging, state-of-the-art production and packaging machinery, ongoing personnel training -> /", "Serves wholesale industry only, not private consumers -> /", "Relies on sales and distribution network and institutional food brokers -> /", "Efficient delivery system, competitive pricing -> /", "Quality assurance integral to manufacturing and packaging -> /", "Two manufacturing facilities -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We are a manufacturing company that serves only the Wholesale Industry", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='four-in-one-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Francis Cable Systems operates from Lakewood, New Jersey. The privately held company was formed in 1978 and began producing UL Listed armored cable products in 1995. No founders are named in the available information.

