UPDATE companies SET description='Gary Platt Seating operates from Sparks, Nevada, where it has produced performance casino seating for over four decades. The company''s history emphasizes a focus on ergonomic design and hand-crafted construction, though no founding year or founder names are disclosed in public materials.

