UPDATE companies SET description='Geffdog Design and Apparel operates from Aberdeen, South Dakota. The company is staffed by customer service professionals and graphic designers who specialize in design for screen printing, embroidery, vinyl graphics, and promotional marketing. The business focuses on earning client relationships through a distinctive shopping experience available both online and at a physical location.

