ployee count 5000 -> db", "Company type distributor/reseller -> description, /services"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Gellco Clothing & Shoes is Oklahoma\u2019s leading provider of Safety Footwear. With over 20 name brands and well over 200 different styles in-stock we offer by far the largest selection in the great state of Oklahoma.", "founded_year": "1959", "employee_count": "5000", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='gellco-work-outfitters' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Generac Power Systems is headquartered in Waukesha, Wisconsin, where it was founded in 1959. The company began as the first to engineer affordable home standby generators and developed the first engine purpose‑built for generator use.

Today Generac manufactures the widest range of power products in the marketplace, spanning portable, residential, commercial, and industrial generators. It also designs and builds manual and fully automatic transfer switches for backup power applications up to 2 MW. The Generac Mobile line adds light towers, trailer‑mounted mobile generators, and combination units for demanding environments. The company pioneered the residential power washer category and now offers a full line of power washers, pressure washers, water pumps, solar battery storage systems, and smart home energy management platforms.

The company cites its early innovations — first affordable home standby generator, first dedicated generator engine — and its position as the #1 manufacturer of home backup generators as key differentiators. It also emphasizes the breadth of its product portfolio, leadership in transfer switches up to 2 MW, and a commitment to sustainability outlined in its 2025 Sustainability & Impact Report.', certifications=ARRAY['ENERGY STAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Design and manufacture of home standby generators", "Design and manufacture of portable generators", "Design and manufacture of commercial and industrial generators", "Design and manufacture of automatic and manual transfer switches (up to 2\u202fMW)", "Design and manufacture of mobile generators and light towers", "Design and manufacture of power washers and pressure washers", "Solar battery storage systems", "Smart home energy management platforms", "Water pump systems"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Construction", "Mobile power", "Renewable energy"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["First to engineer affordable home standby generators (1959)", "First engine developed specifically for generator use", "#1 manufacturer of home backup generators", "Widest range of power products including portable, residential, commercial, and industrial generators", "Leading designer and manufacturer of transfer switches up to 2\u202fMW"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1959 -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Waukesha, Wisconsin -> db", "First to engineer affordable home standby generators -> /about-us", "First engine developed specifically for generator use -> /about-us", "#1 manufacturer of home backup generators -> /about-us", "Manufactures portable, residential, commercial, and industrial generators -> /about-us", "Leading designer and manufacturer of manual and fully automatic transfer switches up to 2 MW -> /about-us", "Generac