UPDATE companies SET description='General Transformer Corporation has operated from Wylie, Texas since 1976. The company was founded as a custom transformer and magnetics manufacturer and has remained at the same location for nearly five decades.

The company designs and builds custom transformers, inductors, chokes, line conditioners, and related magnetics for industrial applications. Its capabilities include custom design and engineering, in-house coil winding, and an ISO 9001:2015 quality system. With a staff of 2–10 employees, the firm handles orders ranging from prototype units to production runs of thousands, all manufactured at its Texas facility.

Primary markets include traffic control systems, oil and gas, and general industrial sectors. The company serves OEM customers globally, shipping a significant portion of its output internationally while maintaining domestic production.

General Transformer emphasizes its "Optimum Design" philosophy, which tailors each magnetic component to the exact application rather than adapting off‑the‑shelf designs. It highlights U.S. manufacturing, a large material inventory for quick turnaround, automated testing with LABView software, barcode serialization, and decades‑long customer relationships as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom design and engineering", "In-house coil winding", "ISO 9001:2015 quality system", "Full engineering services", "Barcode serialization and data storage", "Automated production testing (LABView)", "Prototype to production manufacturing", "Transformer testing and inspection", "Custom magnetic topology design (Optimum Design)"], "industries": ["Traffic control systems", "Oil and gas", "General industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["LABView Software (automated production testing)", "Transformer testing equipment"], "volume": "Prototype to production (small quantities to thousands)", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All manufacturing performed in the USA at the Wylie, Texas plant", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system with zero\u2011defect target", "Optimum Design philosophy for application\u2011specific magnetic topology", "Large material stock enabling quick prototype and production turnaround", "Automated production testing with LABView software and barcode serialization"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1976 -> db", "Headquarters Wylie, Texas -> db", "Employee count 2-10 -> db", "Certification ISO 9001:2015 -> db", "Capabilities: custom design, in-house coil winding, ISO 9001 quality system -> db", "Products: custom transformers, inductors, line conditioners, magnetics -> db", "Industries served: traffic control systems, oil and gas, general industrial -> db", "LinkedIn URL -> db", "Manufacturing in USA at Wylie plant -> /about-us", "Optimum Design philosophy -> /quality", "Quick turnaround v