UPDATE companies SET description='General Woodcraft Inc. was founded in 1949 in New London, Connecticut.

The firm operates a custom woodworking and architectural millwork facility producing custom mouldings, mantels, countertops, and wooden boat parts. It also stocks marine-grade plywood, a wide range of figured and exotic lumber, bamboo, and hardwood plywood.

