UPDATE companies SET description='Generation III, operating as Generations Millwork, is a family-owned carpentry and millwork shop based in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma. The company was founded in April 1990 by Chuck Clowers, initially working as carpenters and home builders. Their first project was a large home in Oakdale Farms, after which they opened a dedicated shop to focus on cabinetry, furniture, and trim work.

The shop produces custom cabinetry, furniture, doors, mantels, wine cellars, tables, closet and media units, and other millwork. Residential projects account for roughly 50% of business, commercial cabinetry for 30%, and creative specialty pieces for the remaining 20%. Work ranges from full custom homes to individual bathroom vanities, pergolas, and entry gates. The company has also completed interior fit-outs for custom coaches, buses, yachts, and train cars. Commercial projects have included banks and law offices spanning 1,500 to 15,000 square feet.

The firm has served banks, law offices, and private clients seeking custom interiors for coaches, buses, yachts, and rail cars.

The company emphasizes problem-solving, service, creativity, and maintaining the highest standard of quality. It backs its work with warranties and a satisfaction guarantee, drawing on over 38 years of experience.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry", "Custom furniture design and fabrication", "Door and mantel fabrication", "Wine cellar installation", "Table fabrication", "Closet and media unit fabrication", "Residential carpentry", "Commercial cabinetry", "Custom home interiors", "Vehicle interior fabrication (coaches, buses, yachts, train cars)", "Entry gate fabrication", "Pergola construction", "Bathroom vanity fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Marine interiors", "Transportation interiors"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and locally operated", "Over 38 years of experience", "Warranties available on work", "Satisfaction guaranteed", "Problem-solving, creative approach with emphasis on quality"], "facts_used": ["Founded April 1990 by Chuck Clowers -> /about", "Family-owned and locally operated -> /", "First project: large home in Oakdale Farms -> /about", "Opened shop for cabinetry, furniture, trim -> /about", "Business mix: 50% residential, 30% commercial, 20% creative -> /about", "Projects range from custom homes to bathroom vanities, pergolas, entry gates -> /about", "Completed interiors for custom coaches, buses, yachts, train cars -> /about", "Commercial projects include banks and law offices (1,500\u201315,000 sq ft) -> /about", "Offers custom cabinetry, furniture, doors, mantels, wine cellars, tables, closet/media units -> /", "Warranties available, satisfaction guaranteed -> /", "Over 38 years of experience -> /", "Headquarters: Oklahoma City, Oklahoma -> db", "Company name: Generation III (also Generations Millwork) -> /about and db"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop