UPDATE companies SET description='George T. Hall Company (GTH) was founded in 1932 in Anaheim, California, by George Hall. For nearly a century the firm has operated under the motto "The House That Service Built." Today the business is led by Chairman Chuck Niemann and President Dina Johnson, with an executive team that includes a U.S. Navy veteran serving as technical manager in the Reno panel shop.

GTH manufactures custom UL‑certified control panels (UL 508A and UL 698A) in two dedicated panel shops located in California and Nevada. The company provides full‑service control solutions that span design, programming, instrumentation, control panel manufacturing, field services, system integration, and product distribution. As a CSIA‑certified system integrator since 2017, GTH modernizes legacy automation, delivers PLC and SCADA programming, and supports the full lifecycle of industrial control systems from commissioning through preventive maintenance.

The company serves public and private industrial customers across the western United States. Its industry portfolio includes water and wastewater, mining/minerals/metals, food and beverage, pharmaceutical and life sciences, general manufacturing, and aerospace. For mining projects GTH deploys MSHA‑ and BROWZ‑certified engineers; for food and beverage it applies ISA‑ and FDA‑aligned expertise; and for pharmaceutical clients it provides traceable PLC/SCADA systems that meet strict regulatory requirements.

GTH differentiates itself by combining panel fabrication, integration, field service, and distribution under one roof, reducing handoffs and accelerating project timelines. Its quality management system is certified to ISO 9001:2015 by DQS, and the firm emphasizes a culture of continuous improvement rooted in its founding service legacy. A recent white paper highlighted the ability to reuse up to 95 % of existing PLC code during SCADA migrations, preserving customer investment while lowering risk.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','CSIA Certified System Integrator','UL 508A','UL 698A','MSHA','BROWZ']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom control panel manufacturing (UL 508A/UL 698A)", "Industrial system integration", "PLC and SCADA programming", "Field services (programming, calibration, repair, preventive maintenance)", "Instrumentation and control design", "Thermal and process automation", "Legacy automation modernization", "Cybersecurity-focused upgrades", "Product distribution", "Project management and commissioning"], "industries": ["Water & Wastewater", "Mining, Minerals, & Metals", "Food & Beverage", "Pharmaceutical & Life Sciences", "Manufacturing", "Aerospace"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Two UL\u2011certified panel shops in California and Nevada", "CSIA Certified System Integrator since 2017", "ISO 9001:2015 certification (DQS)", "Single\u2011source delivery: panel manufacturing, integration, field services, and distribution", "MSHA\u2011 and BROWZ\u2011certified engineering staff for mining projects"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1932 in Anaheim, CA -> homepage, about-us", "Motto ''The House That Service Built'' -> homepage, about-us", "Chairman Chuck Niemann, President Dina Johnson -> about-us", "Two UL panel shops in California and Nevada -> homepage", "CSIA Certified System Integrator since 2017 -> homepage", "ISO 9001:2015 certified by DQS -> homepage, about-us", "Industries 