UPDATE companies SET description='Gilbert Creek Woodworks was founded in 1987 by Duane Zweber in Menomonie, Wisconsin. After 30 years as a production manager and head of product design for two large woodworking firms, Zweber established his own shop to produce custom wood products. The business remains family-run, with his sons Brian and Robert now involved in finishing and operations.

The company designs, manufactures, and finishes a range of custom woodwork, including kitchen cabinets, office furniture, entertainment centers, and architectural millwork.

Gilbert Creek serves both residential and commercial clients, producing pieces for individual homeowners as well as businesses seeking custom office environments. Duane Zweber’s background includes projects for individuals and companies around the world, and the company’s website highlights work for homes, businesses, and special projects.

