UPDATE companies SET description='Global Electronics Ltd. operates from New Baltimore, Michigan, where it develops and supplies automotive emissions calibration and end-of-line testing equipment. The company, structured as a limited liability entity, serves automotive OEMs and tier suppliers with specialized electronic test hardware and engineering services. No founding year or ownership details are disclosed.

