UPDATE companies SET description='Global Textile Alliance, Inc. (GTA USA) is headquartered in Reidsville, North Carolina, in the heart of the state''s textile region. The company was founded in 2001 by principals who each brought two decades of experience in the textile and bedding industries. Its roots trace back to a Belgian weaving mill with fabric production and design knowledge dating to 1953, and the operation expanded globally before establishing a vertical manufacturing facility in Reidsville.

GTA USA operates a fully vertical plant that handles yarn extrusion, warping, weaving, circular knitting, and finishing. The facility produces mattress and upholstery fabrics, as well as curtain fabrics, for the bedding and furniture markets. Design, development, and sales functions are consolidated at the Reidsville location, where textile engineers and designers collaborate on constructions, patterns, and colorations.

The company serves bedding and furniture manufacturers, supplying mattress fabrics, headboard and border fabrics, and upholstery and curtain fabrics for the broader home market.

