UPDATE companies SET description='Golden Barrel Products, based in Honey Brook, Pennsylvania, traces its roots to 1934 when M. Simon Zook founded the Zook Molasses Company to supply local farmers with feeding molasses. The family-owned, woman-owned business expanded in 1980 when Zook''s daughter Sally and her husband Larry Martin launched the Golden Barrel brand, moving into cooking and baking supplies. Today the company operates two family-run facilities in Honey Brook and Leola, Pennsylvania.

The company produces a full line of baking ingredients and sweeteners — including molasses, syrups, sugars, cooking oils, baking mixes, and fondants — with capabilities in liquid and dry blending, warehousing, private labeling, and transportation. Its two rail-served plants give it the scale to be one of the Northeast''s largest processors of bulk sweeteners such as corn syrups, invert sugars, and dextrose, while still packing retail-size products.

Golden Barrel serves baking, confection, snack, beverage, and food-service customers of every size, from local bakeries to national distributors. Its products reach kitchens and food businesses across the country through a network of distributors and online channels.

The business was built on a commitment to quality that began with feeding molasses and carried into the kitchen, emphasizing pure, natural ingredients and nearly a century of craft. The company highlights its rail-served capacity, custom blending flexibility, and end-to-end services from blending to delivery as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Food Service Manufacturing", "Liquid Blending", "Dry Blending", "Warehousing", "Private Labeling", "Transportation", "Bulk Sweetener Processing", "Custom Blending", "Retail Packing"], "industries": ["Baking", "Confection", "Snack", "Beverage", "Food Service"], "materials": ["Molasses", "Syrups", "Sugars", "Cooking Oils", "Baking Mixes", "Fondants", "Corn Syrups", "Invert Sugars", "Dextrose", "Organic Products"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1934 by M. Simon Zook -> /about-us", "Family-owned and woman-owned -> /, /about-us", "Two facilities in Honey Brook and Leola, PA -> /about-us", "200+ custom liquid blends -> /, /about-us", "45+ quality products -> /", "Processes: liquid/dry blending, warehousing, private labeling, transportation -> /about-us", "Industries: baking, confection, snack, beverage, food-service -> /about-us", "Rail-served capacity, one of Northeast''s largest bulk sweetener processors -> /about-us", "Products: molasses, syrups, sugars, cooking oils, baking mixes, fondants, corn syrups, invert sugars, dextrose -> /about-us", "Headquarters Honey Brook, Pennsylvania -> db, /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Today, Golden Barrel is produced at two family-run facilities in Honey Brook and Leola, Pennsylvania. Together they give us the scale and rail-served capacity to be one of the Northeast''s largest processors of bulk sweeteners", "founded_year": "1934", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "la