UPDATE companies SET description='Grand Solar, Inc. was established in Honolulu, Hawaii, in 1980 and incorporated in 1985. The company was founded by John Grandinetti, who remains actively involved and is present at every residential and commercial solar installation the firm completes.

The business focuses on the design, installation, and service of solar thermal systems, covering nearly every type sold in Hawaii. Its offerings include the Blazing Tubes system, conventional pump solar hot water systems, thermosyphon solar hot water systems, and residential photovoltaic systems that use only U.S.-manufactured components.

Grand Solar serves both residential and commercial customers across Hawaii. Its client base includes homeowners and businesses seeking solar thermal and photovoltaic installations, with the company positioning itself as a leader in the local solar thermal market.

The company emphasizes its use of U.S.-made photovoltaic components backed by performance warranties. It has maintained an A+ rating with the Better Business Bureau since 1990, has no complaints on record with the state''s Regulated Industries Complaint Office, and is a member in good standing of the Hawaii Solar Energy Association.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar thermal system design", "Solar thermal system installation", "Solar thermal system service", "Blazing Tubes system installation", "Conventional pump solar hot water system installation", "Thermosyphon solar hot water system installation", "Residential photovoltaic system installation"], "industries": ["Solar thermal systems", "Photovoltaic systems", "Residential solar installation", "Commercial solar installation"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Blazing Tubes system"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["U.S.-manufactured photovoltaic components only", "Industry-leading performance warranties", "Founder John Grandinetti present at every installation", "A+ Better Business Bureau rating since 1990", "Zero complaints filed with Hawaii RICO"], "facts_used": ["Established in Hawaii in 1980 -> /about", "Incorporated in 1985 -> /about", "Founder John Grandinetti present at all installations -> /about", "Leader in design, installation, service of solar thermal systems in Hawaii -> /about", "Photovoltaic systems use U.S.-manufactured components only -> /about", "BBB member since 1990 with A+ rating -> /about", "No complaints with RICO -> /about", "Member of Hawaii Solar Energy Association -> /about", "Blazing Tubes system, conventional pump, thermosyphon systems offered -> /", "Residential PV systems offered -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "design, installation and service of nearly every type of solar thermal system sold in Hawaii", "founded_year": "1980", "employee_count": "", "cage_cod