UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1966 in Los Angeles, California, Great American Packaging has operated as a custom flexible packaging manufacturer for over five decades. The company produces poly bags, films, and specialty bags for food, ice, medical, and consumer applications.

Great American Packaging controls the entire production process in-house, from extrusion and printing to converting finished products. The facility is IFS PACsecure certified, meeting stringent food safety standards, and uses FDA- and USDA-approved materials.

The company serves industries including food processing, ice manufacturing, medical device packaging, and consumer goods. Its products are stocked by major retailers such as Costco and The Home Depot. Customers range from health and safety product manufacturers to food suppliers who rely on the company''s food safety certified packaging and low lead times.

